    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is that the encroachment clause is being used by the neighbor to argue that any new construction is essentially an invasion of their space. they're being really aggressive about the \"encroachment\" aspect, basically claiming the new build would violate their boundary rights. how can i counter that specific argument without making the setbacks the main issue?",
